      "reasoning": "Customary IHL, reflected in the treaty provisions of Additional Protocol I art.54(2) and recognized by the International Court of Justice and the International Criminal Tribunal for the former Yugoslavia, establishes an erga omnes norm prohibiting starvation as a method of warfare and barring attacks on objects indispensable to civilian survival for that purpose. Even absent treaty application, the conduct breaches this customary rule because it was undertaken with the purpose of depriving civilians of water and food.",
